%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': { 'primaryColor': '#4f46e5', 'primaryTextColor': '#fff', 'lineColor': '#6b7280'}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant N as Next.js
    participant Q as Qdrant
    participant L as LLM
    participant T as Tavily

    Note over B,N: Chat Flow (AD-9: last 7 turns)
    U->>B: Type message
    B->>N: POST /api/chat
    
    rect rgb(16, 185, 129, 0.1)
        Note over N: Retrieval Phase (AD-8)
        N->>Q: Vector search (topK=5, minScore=0.30)
        Q-->>N: Retrieved chunks (scoped by notebookId)
    end
    
    rect rgb(245, 158, 11, 0.1)
        Note over N: Citation Mapping
        N->>N: Validate chunkIds, drop unknown markers
    end
    
    rect rgb(79, 70, 229, 0.1)
        Note over N: LLM Reasoning
        N->>L: Grounded answer request<br/>+ chunks + citations
        L-->>N: Streaming response<br/>+ [[C:chunkId]] markers
    end
    
    alt Refusal / Low Confidence
        Note over N: Web Search Offer (AD-13)
        N-->>B: Offer web search
        U->>B: Approve search
        B->>N: Confirm search
        N->>T: Tavily search
        T-->>N: Search results
        N->>L: Retry with context
    end
    
    N-->>B: Stream answer + citations
    B-->>U: Render message